{"asset_key":"ep4/gameplay_story_14601120","episode":"ep4","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"14601120","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1460112001:1":{"text":"ふはははっ！<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、やはり君との戦いは実に愉快爽快だ！","source_cn":"哈哈哈，不错！和<style=stress><play...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDE29CB595D522098","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ふはははっ！<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、やはり君との戦いは実に愉快爽快だ！","female":"ふはははっ！<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>、やはり君との戦いは実に愉快爽快だ！","variant_male_record_index":"169494","variant_female_record_index":"169495","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1460112002:1":{"text":"どうだ、今の戦いで何か分かったかな？","source_cn":"怎么样，朋友，看出来什么没有？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x540D4CCD82FDCAEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1460112003:1":{"text":"最初の戦いで感じたとおり、貴殿の技は鍛えに鍛え抜かれ、もはや達人の域に達している。","source_cn":"正如之前战斗时瞥到的一样，你的武技千锤百炼，已经极为出众了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x619A3B18265ADB18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1460112004:1":{"text":"単独で戦う際も、防御を怠らず、微塵も隙がないと言えるだろう。","source_cn":"在单独行动时，无时无刻不在防守，几乎毫无破绽。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF16DA27658AF953F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1460112005:1":{"text":"攻撃に転じた時の、猪突猛進の如き勢い、特に鎧をも砕かんばかりの凄まじい斬撃は、拙者も大いに感銘を受けたぞ。","source_cn":"进攻时