,"status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E96AB37AB02E0DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1460112011:0":{"text":"さすれば、臨機応変に動くことはかなわずとも、簡単に陣形を崩されることもあるまい。","source_cn":"这样，他们即使无法随机应变，但至少不会被那么轻易地分开。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84E653A5410F8318","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1460112012:1":{"text":"ほう、それはいい案だな！","source_cn":"哦？这相当可行啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C99E09E068E618B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1460112013:1":{"text":"むろん、これはあくまで応急策。真の戦士になるには、地道な合同練習を重ねていくしかないがな。","source_cn":"——当然，这只是个速成法，要想成为战士，还是得一步一个...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x504FE0129B237C96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1460112014:0":{"text":"ああ、もちろんだ。我らブラックロアーは、実践から得る経験を重んじているが、日々の鍛錬だっておろそかにはしない。","source_cn":"放心，这道理我懂！虽说我们黑嚎部落向来推崇从实战中获取...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DEF79584D80B2A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1460112015:0":{"text":"ただ、うちの連中は、揃いも揃って身勝手な奴ばかりでな。協力して戦うことを嫌うのだ。","source_cn":"只不过小子们一个赛一个自以为是，从来不喜欢和人组队战斗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64"